              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fini i ma ngulupi fezu edetaru pale kakau, ekile atalau edeta edepi agapi rarini file Pari Alatararuri ma alia eli vusi eli vusi, ari ovupi eriniru kuri berile ku; ",
